{"title":"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a2b6b7c193f9ba2b2134a59f1da5addcfbc98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> be the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/d/13d3d5e9f45e6798cae12e334c6fb43d67a91fba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n-1} + a_{n-2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/d/b4d03af3d43ad5652b0ab9dc7deec092c9943b89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall \\, n\\ge3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d00d45c7f72de91ddae31751503f0a62a4210f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1=0, a_2=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"17\" />, find the value of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/7/2371cd3244d0b68c2b8e15d1d1082bba10f5c14d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=1}^{2026} a_i\\]\" width=\"43\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's test for small values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. We have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e10940118ce4bc4f7a6ee82dbbdab4539f06fbd6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a_1=0 \\\\ a_2=2 \\\\ a_3=2 \\\\ a_4=1 \\\\  a_5=0 \\\\ a_6=1 \\\\ a_7=1 \\\\ a_8=2 \\\\ a_9=0 \\\\ a_{10}=2 \\\\ a_{11}=2 \\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"56\" height=\"264\" />\nNotice that this has a cycle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, as it starts repeating at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e105b8d7fa6daad3bbd5de10587ab356fd47fa6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\bmod 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" />. We want to find the sum of the values from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87acfb2c9d6052d947fd65eff7e4583d5eaa8d64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2026}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" />. The sum of a single cycle is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/7/01708440b3f6461b0c06c1e94847ebf92fdbf46f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0+2+2+1+0+1+1+2=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"263\" height=\"15\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/4/96421cbff85b4c58334305e74013a95f8cb4e08f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2026=253\\cdot8+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"143\" height=\"15\" />, then the sum is equal to the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/5/8350ad56249c4928110c3e8b558ca84a2df815af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$253$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> cycles and the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/7/8672844162eb1e10b48e85f86caa76057dc34679.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"11\" />, since they are the terms when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/7/95743039c745993acf24cdf0b77386de2eb4f738.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2 \\bmod 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" />. Hence, we can write:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/c/6dc67650afe768f805828e1ad8b71ea61153669d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=1}^{2026} a_i=253\\cdot9+0+2=\\boxed{2279}\\]\" width=\"252\" height=\"50\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO\">2026 Indonesia District MO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" 